<html>
<head>
<title>The Improved Sorting Algorithm Demo</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../../morin.css">
</head>

<body>
<div class="title">Sorting Algorithms</div>

<p>This page has visualizations of some comparison based sorting
algorithms.  The quick sort, bubble sort and cocktail shaker sort are
due to the good folks at Sun Microsystems. The original SortItem
applet was written by James Gosling.</p>

<p>
<em>Click on the applets to watch them sort.</em>
</p>


<center><table border=5 cellspacing=10>

<tr>
<td>
<applet code=SortItem.class width=125 height=150>
<param name="alg" value="StoogeSort">
</applet>
</td>

<td>
<applet code=SortItem.class width=125 height=150>
<param name="alg" value="QSort">
</applet>
</td>

<td>
<applet code=SortItem.class width=125 height=150>
<param name="alg" value="JSort">
</applet>
</td>
</tr>

</table></center>


